{"id":"a628124170578d91","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-noisy-long-code-test.md","title":"带独立翻转噪声的三查询长码测试","display":"df-noisy-long-code-test — 带独立翻转噪声的三查询长码测试","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-noisy-long-code-test","aliases":["28-df-noisy-long-code-test"],"display":"df-noisy-long-code-test — 带独立翻转噪声的三查询长码测试","depends_on":[],"source_book_location":"§22.6 before Lemma 22.24","source_printed_pages":"480","source_pdf_pages":"506","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-noisy-long-code-test"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-noisy-long-code-test</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-noisy-long-code-test — 带独立翻转噪声的三查询长码测试"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§22.6 before Lemma 22.24"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"480"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"506"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{-1,1\\}^W\\to\\{-1,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{-1,1\\}^W\\to\\{-1,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in[0,1]\">\\(\\rho\\in[0,1]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\">\\(x,y\\)</span> 独立均匀符号向量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 与其独立，各坐标独立且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr[z_i=-1]=\\rho\">\\(\\Pr[z_i=-1]=\\rho\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"xyz\">\\(xyz\\)</span> 为逐坐标乘积。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(xyz)_i\\coloneqq x_i y_i z_i\\qquad(x,y,z\\in\\{-1,1\\}^W,\\ i\\in[W]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(xyz)_i\\coloneqq x_i y_i z_i\\qquad(x,y,z\\in\\{-1,1\\}^W,\\ i\\in[W]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_W(x)\\coloneqq2^{-W}\\qquad(x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^W).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_W(x)\\coloneqq2^{-W}\\qquad(x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^W).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pr[Z_\\rho=z]\\coloneqq\\prod_{i=1}^W\\left((1-\\rho)\\mathbf1_{\\{1\\}}(z_i)+\\rho\\mathbf1_{\\{-1\\}}(z_i)\\right)\\qquad(z\\in\\{-1,1\\}^W).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pr[Z_\\rho=z]\\coloneqq\\prod_{i=1}^W\\left((1-\\rho)\\mathbf1_{\\{1\\}}(z_i)+\\rho\\mathbf1_{\\{-1\\}}(z_i)\\right)\\qquad(z\\in\\{-1,1\\}^W).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LCAcc}_\\rho(f)\\coloneqq\\Pr_{x,y,z\\leftarrow U_W\\times U_W\\times Z_\\rho}[f(x)f(y)=f(xyz)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LCAcc}_\\rho(f)\\coloneqq\\Pr_{x,y,z\\leftarrow U_W\\times U_W\\times Z_\\rho}[f(x)f(y)=f(xyz)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LCAcc}_\\rho(x\\mapsto x_j)=1-\\rho\\qquad(j\\in[W]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LCAcc}_\\rho(x\\mapsto x_j)=1-\\rho\\qquad(j\\in[W]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>独立乘积质量在所有 z 上和为一，ρ=0 或 1 的退化噪声也良定义。坐标函数测试等价于 z_j=1，所以接受率恰为 1−ρ；测试不宣称所有接受率高的函数本身就是坐标函数。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§22.6 before Lemma 22.24；印刷页 480；PDF 页 506。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{-1,1\\}^W\\to\\{-1,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"x,y","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr[z_i=-1]=\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"xyz","display":false},{"tex":"(xyz)_i\\coloneqq x_i y_i z_i\\qquad(x,y,z\\in\\{-1,1\\}^W,\\ i\\in[W]).","display":true},{"tex":"U_W(x)\\coloneqq2^{-W}\\qquad(x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^W).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pr[Z_\\rho=z]\\coloneqq\\prod_{i=1}^W\\left((1-\\rho)\\mathbf1_{\\{1\\}}(z_i)+\\rho\\mathbf1_{\\{-1\\}}(z_i)\\right)\\qquad(z\\in\\{-1,1\\}^W).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LCAcc}_\\rho(f)\\coloneqq\\Pr_{x,y,z\\leftarrow U_W\\times U_W\\times Z_\\rho}[f(x)f(y)=f(xyz)].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LCAcc}_\\rho(x\\mapsto x_j)=1-\\rho\\qquad(j\\in[W]).","display":true}],"bytes":1637,"backlinks":[{"id":"53ae7f63203f2960","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f,\\rho,W,\\operatorname{LCAcc}_\\rho$ 采用 [[28-df-noisy-long-code-test]]；$\\widehat f(S),\\chi_S$ 见 [[28-df-fourier-transform]]；$S\\subseteq[W]$。有限整数幂采用空积约定 $a^0=1$（包括 $a=0$）。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-406","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-csp-instance]]、[[28-df-cl-reduction]]、[[28-df-constraint-graph]]、[[28-df-projection-game]]、[[28-df-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-thm-raz-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-df-long-code]]、[[28-df-bifolded-boolean-function]]、[[28-lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support]]、[[28-thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test]]、[[28-df-noisy-long-code-test]]、[[28-lem-noisy-long-code-fourier-moment]]、[[28-df-set-cover-partition-gadget]]、[[28-thm-hastad-three-query-pcp]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}